    "updated_at": "2026-11-11T22:23:54Z",
    "body": "Batch gate on this PR's own tree (head 64217219, cold build in a fresh worktree, sccache on): **green, 9 steps, 0 failed, 35.4 min**.\n\n| Step | Wall | Passed / ignored |\n|---|---|---|\n| geometry | 12 s | 77 / 0 |\n| cl | 2 s | 36 / 0 |\n| tools | 10 s | 57 / 0 |\n| post | 91 s | 59 / 0 |\n| sim | 260 s | 427 / 4 |\n| motion | 299 s | 637 / 12 |\n| app | 1030 s | 1963 / 18 |\n| ui | 318 s | 648 / 6 |\n| clippy `-D warnings` | 97 s | - |\n\nPass and ignore counts are identical to the batch gate on `main` (0e36fd14) run the same evening with the old profile, so no test is affected by dependency `opt-level` 1 or the lighter debug info. The worktree's `target/` ended at 24 GB. The gate set the sccache wrapper by itself; the runner's end-of-run stats showed a cold cache (no hits), so this run does not demonstrate the warm-cache saving - that is to be read off the next gates after the merge. Logs: `gate-logs/pr913-batch/`. Flagged ready on this result.\n",
